sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Bitrix as Веб-портал (Битрикс)
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant Sec as Security (X-API-Key)
    participant TS as TranslationService
    participant GS as GlossaryService
    participant PS as PromptService
    participant LLM as LLM Server (HTTP :8001)

    Bitrix->>API: POST /api/v1/translate (JSON + X-API-Key)
    API->>Sec: verify_api_key(x_api_key)
    alt Неверный заголовок X-API-Key
        Sec-->>Bitrix: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    API->>TS: translate(TranslationRequest)
    TS->>GS: match_terms(text, limit=5)
    Note over GS: Лемматизация через pymorphy3<br/>Поиск по лемма-индексу
    GS-->>TS: matched_terms_list
    TS->>PS: build_user_prompt(text, terms)
    PS-->>TS: formatted_user_prompt
    TS->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions (HTTP REST)
    Note over LLM: Инференс модели (vLLM / LiteLLM / MLX Server)
    LLM-->>TS: 200 OK (JSON completion)
    TS-->>API: TranslationResponse
    API-->>Bitrix: 200 OK (news_id, translated_title, detail_text, meta)
